Nine Multitude Bugs !

278
00:17:13,320 --> 00:17:14,490
Sword-Sealing Restriction,

279
00:17:14,520 --> 00:17:15,410
activate !

280
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:19,450
This is bad,

281
00:17:19,200 --> 00:17:20,930
