307
00:18:58,550 --> 00:19:04,120
In a world of murk and shadow,

308
00:19:00,450 --> 00:19:04,120
only the flame of truth can light the way.

309
00:19:03,910 --> 00:19:09,840
Look at them all,

310
00:19:06,790 --> 00:19:09,840
