315
00:19:20,760 --> 00:19:26,440
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

316
00:19:22,450 --> 00:19:26,440
I will fight.

317
00:19:26,190 --> 00:19:29,560
I'll break through the abyss of despair

318
00:19:29,310 --> 00:19:32,600
