324
00:19:45,510 --> 00:19:49,200
I'll still fight.

325
00:19:49,150 --> 00:19:52,560
It's hard to avoid loneliness

326
00:19:52,310 --> 00:19:55,600
when you are above everyone else.

327
00:19:55,350 --> 00:20:01,280
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

328
00:19:57,670 --> 00:20:01,280
be afraid of a firefly ?
